<title>USA: Guilderland CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Guilderland CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross Inc. said it won $6.450 million of Guilderland CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.2724 percent.</p>
